                <pb facs="0982" n="866" sameAs="frus:frus1923v01/pg866"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.60 f 2/2: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Czechoslovakia</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Einstein</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Prague</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1923-07-21T13:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 21, 1923—1
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received July 23—4:10
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>34. Your 27. Minister for Foreign Affairs assures me that Czechoslovak Government
                    will be very glad to negotiate a general treaty.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Einstein</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
